Package: observer
Version: 0.1.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Federico Cardinali <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: aspnetcore-runtime-10.0, adduser, libc6, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~)
Recommends: libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libxext6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxrender1, libx11-xcb1, libgl1, libegl1
Description: Machine metrics service and dashboard
 Observer samples CPU and memory and serves them over HTTP and a local unix
 socket. The service generates and keeps its own machine token on first
 start, so nothing has to be configured after installation.
 .
 To watch the machine you are sitting at you need no token at all: the
 dashboard comes in through the local socket, and membership of the observer
 group is what grants access. The token exists only so another computer can
 query this one.
